  (null, null, 'or-marine', 'salt', 'note', 'Regulations can change inseason, check https://myodfw.com/fishing/marine-zone before you go fishing. The Commission set the 2026 groundfish regulations December 12, 2025; the marine bag and lingcod limits were trimmed inseason in 2025 when harvest guidelines approached.', 'https://myodfw.com/news/commission-sets-2026-groundfish-seasons', 'ODFW — Commission sets 2026 groundfish seasons (press release)', '2025-12-12', '2026-09-02', 1,
