  ('surfperch', null, 'wa-ma-1-4-coastal', 'salt', 'bag_limit', 'Surfperch and shiner perch are not part of the bottomfish limit. Surfperch has a daily limit of 12 and shiner perch has a daily limit of 15 with no minimum size restriction for either species. Fishing is open on the second Saturday in March through the third Saturday in October – March 14 through Oct. 17, 2026 – except fishing for surfperch is open year-round from the beach.', 'https://wdfw.wa.gov/newsroom/news-release/coastal-recreational-bottomfish-fishery-season-opens-march-14-1', 'WDFW — Coastal recreational bottomfish fishery season opens March 14 (news release)', '2026-03-05', '2026-09-02', 1,
