  ('sixgill_shark', null, 'wa-ma-1-4-coastal', 'salt', 'prohibited', 'Fishing for, retaining, or possessing sixgill, sevengill, and thresher sharks is closed in all marine areas. A sixgill shark may not be removed from the water.', 'https://wdfw.wa.gov/newsroom/news-release/coastal-recreational-bottomfish-fishery-season-opens-march-14-1', 'WDFW — Coastal recreational bottomfish fishery season opens March 14 (news release)', '2026-03-05', '2026-09-02', 1,
